  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Member Profile</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n                                <li>Profile</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Volunteer Details Section Start -->\n                <section class=\"team-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n                                <div class=\"team-desc\">\n                                    <h1>Samuella Kanu</h1>\n                                    <p>Meet Samuella Kanu, a dedicated and accomplished professional in the realm of finance and accounting. With a rich history of academic achievements and practical experience, Samuella brings a unique blend of expertise to the role of Finance/Accounting Officer. Her journey began as an Enumerator at Statistics Sierra Leone, where she gained valuable insights into data analysis and honed her attention to detail. Building on this foundation, she assumed the role of Manager at Elpariso Investment, where her financial acumen flourished, making her an invaluable asset to the organization. Samuella's educational background, including a BSC in Banking and Finance, Diplomas in Banking and Finance and Business Management, as well as her West Africa Senior Secondary Examination (WASSE) certificate, underscore her commitment to excellence. Her analytical prowess and financial management skills make her a standout candidate for any team looking to enhance their financial decision-making processes. Let's delve into Samuella Kanu's profile to explore her qualifications and experience in greater detail.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Education</strong></h5>\n                                    \n                                        <strong>BSC in Banking and Finance</strong>\n                                           <p> Samuella holds a Bachelor of Science degree in Banking and Finance, which provided her with a strong foundation in financial principles and management.</p>\n                                        <strong>Diploma in Banking and Finance</strong>\n                                           <p>In addition to her degree, she holds a Diploma in Banking and Finance, which signifies her specialized knowledge in financial services and banking practices. </p>\n                                        <strong>Diploma in Business Management</strong>\n                                           <p>Samuella's educational background also includes a Diploma in Business Management, indicating her proficiency in overseeing and optimizing business processes. </p>\n                                        <strong>West Africa Senior Secondary Examination Certificate (WASSE)</strong>\n                                           <p>Samuella has a solid academic background, as evidenced by her West Africa Senior Secondary Examination certificate, which showcases her commitment to academic excellence. </p>\n                                   \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <p>Samuella Kanu is an accomplished Finance and Accounting Officer with a wealth of experience in data analysis, financial management, and business operations. Her background includes academic qualifications in banking, finance, and business management, which have prepared her to excel in her roles. With her strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and a proven track record in financial management, Samuella is well-equipped to contribute to any finance or accounting team and make a meaningful impact on financial decision-making processes.</p>\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"row progess-bar-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"85\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">89%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Knowledge in Finance</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"70\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">70%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Communication</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"90\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                    